flowchart LR
  cam[WebCamTexture\n(Unity Camera Frame)] --> sample[Frame Sampler\nLuma + Motion Delta]
  sample --> heuristic[Heuristic Pose Mapper\nleft_wrist / right_wrist / nose]
  heuristic --> smooth[TryUpdate\nconfidenceThreshold + smoothing]
  smooth --> rule{Hands Up?\nleft.y < nose.y && right.y < nose.y}
  rule -->|true| on[Barrier ON]
  rule -->|false| off[Barrier OFF]

  mock[Local Mock Generator] --> smooth
